# The Remotion demo-video project: ~650 MB of renderer, mp4s and stills the
# server never reads. The `node_modules/` line above matches the repo root only,
# so this project brought its own into every image layer.
demo-video/

# `COPY . .` copies the WORKING TREE, so every .gitignore rule that keeps real
# health data, backups and dumps out of the repo has to hold for the image too
# (a manual `fly deploy` does not go through git). tests/dockerignore.test.ts
# pins the pairing. `docs/` deliberately stays: the chatbot reads
# docs/products.md, docs/guideline and docs/blog at runtime. docs/pathway
# (third-party pathways, removed 2026-10-22, US-15 AC39) never enters the image.
docs/pathway/
.git/
